@startuml Y_Manager_Call_Chain
scale 2
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 26
caption v2.2.1 · 归档格式 v3

title 双流水线总览 — 压缩与解压

package "SFC_GUI" {
    class MainWindow {
        + 压缩页与解压页两个标签页
        + 拖放、进度、日志、取消
    }
    class CompressionWorker {
        + setCompressionParams(..)
        + setDecompressionParams(..)
        + doCompression()
        + doDecompression()
        + requestStop() / resetStopFlag() / isStopRequested()
        .. signals ..
        + detailedProgress(..)
        + finished(success, message)
        - validateCompressionParams() : bool
        - validateDecompressionParams() : bool
        - shouldEmitProgress(currentProgress) : bool
    }
    MainWindow *--> CompressionWorker
}

package "Y_Manager" {
    class CompressionLoop {
        + compressionLoop(paths, mode, password)
        - pipelineWorkerCount() : unsigned
        - readerLoop(..)
        - workerLoop(..)
        - writerLoop(..)
        - countTotalFiles(paths)
        - prepareNextFile(..)
        - reportProgress(..)
    }
    class DecompressionLoop {
        + decompressionLoop(mode, password)
        - readerLoop(..)
        - workerLoop(..)
        - writerLoop(..)
        - processLinks(linkTasks)
        - createDirectory(path) / createFile(path)
        - reportProgress(..)
    }
    class BlockTask <<struct>> {
        + sequence : uint64
        + inputData : DataBlock
    }
    class PipelineMessage <<struct>> {
        + sequence : uint64
        + kind : Block 或 Settlement
        + encryptedMetadata : DataBlock
        + encryptedData : DataBlock
        + exception : exception_ptr
        + processedSizeOffset : SlotOffset
    }
    class DecompressTask <<struct>> {
        + sequence : uint64
        + expectedOriginal : FileSize
        + encryptedMetadata : DataBlock
        + encryptedData : DataBlock
    }
    class DecompressionMessage <<struct>> {
        + sequence : uint64
        + kind : Block 或 FileStart
        + decompressedData : DataBlock
        + exception : exception_ptr
        + outputPath : path
        + originalSize : FileSize
    }
    CompressionLoop ..> BlockTask
    CompressionLoop ..> PipelineMessage
    DecompressionLoop ..> DecompressTask
    DecompressionLoop ..> DecompressionMessage
}

package "并发组件" {
    class "SafeQueue<T>" as SafeQueue {
        + push(value) : bool
        + waitPop(value) : bool
        + setDone()
    }
    class "WriteSorter<T>" as WriteSorter {
        + canWrite(sequence, message) : bool
        + takeInOrder() : vector~T~
        + drainAll() : vector~T~
        + getSize() : uint64
    }
    class BufferPool {
        + acquire() : DataBlock
        + release(block)
        + close()
        + capacity() : size_t
        + available() : size_t
    }
}

package "CompressorFileSystem" {
    class StrategyFactory {
        + {static} createModules(mode, password)
        + {static} idToMode(id)
        + {static} hasEncryption(mode) : bool
    }
    class BinaryStandardLoader {
        + headerLoaderIterator(encryption)
        + takeBlockSpans() : vector~BlockSpan~
        + restartLoader()
        + fileQueue : FileTaskQueue
    }
    class DataLoader {
        + dataLoader()
        + getBlock() : const DataBlock&
        + reset(path)
    }
    class DataExporter {
        + exportCompressedData(data)
        + exportDecompressedData(data)
        + currentFileProcessedSize() : FileSize
        + startNextFile()
    }
    class CatalogFinalizer {
        + finalize(sizeEntries, spans, encryption, mode)
    }
    class HeaderWriter {
        + headerWriter(paths, outPath, logicalRoot, mode)
    }
}

CompressionWorker ..> HeaderWriter : 建档
CompressionWorker ..> CompressionLoop
CompressionWorker ..> DecompressionLoop

CompressionLoop ..> SafeQueue : 任务队列
CompressionLoop ..> BufferPool : 背压
CompressionLoop ..> WriteSorter : 定序
DecompressionLoop ..> SafeQueue
DecompressionLoop ..> BufferPool
DecompressionLoop ..> WriteSorter

CompressionLoop ..> StrategyFactory : 私有模块
CompressionLoop ..> BinaryStandardLoader
CompressionLoop ..> DataLoader
CompressionLoop ..> DataExporter
CompressionLoop ..> CatalogFinalizer : 收尾
DecompressionLoop ..> StrategyFactory
DecompressionLoop ..> BinaryStandardLoader
DecompressionLoop ..> DataExporter

' ── 版面控制：以下连线不渲染，只用于摆放 ──
' 四个包摆成两行两列
"SFC_GUI" -right[hidden]-> "Y_Manager"
"Y_Manager" -right[hidden]-> "CompressorFileSystem"
"SFC_GUI" -down[hidden]-> "并发组件"
"并发组件" -right[hidden]-> "CompressorFileSystem"

' SFC_GUI：主窗口在上，工人对象在下
MainWindow -down[hidden]-> CompressionWorker

' Y_Manager：两条流水线各带自己的块消息，摆成两行三列
CompressionLoop -right[hidden]-> BlockTask
BlockTask -right[hidden]-> PipelineMessage
CompressionLoop -down[hidden]-> DecompressionLoop
DecompressionLoop -right[hidden]-> DecompressTask
DecompressTask -right[hidden]-> DecompressionMessage
BlockTask -down[hidden]-> DecompressTask
PipelineMessage -down[hidden]-> DecompressionMessage

' 并发组件：三件并排
SafeQueue -right[hidden]-> BufferPool
BufferPool -right[hidden]-> WriteSorter

' 文件系统：摆成两行三列
StrategyFactory -right[hidden]-> BinaryStandardLoader
BinaryStandardLoader -right[hidden]-> CatalogFinalizer
StrategyFactory -down[hidden]-> DataLoader
DataLoader -right[hidden]-> DataExporter
DataExporter -right[hidden]-> HeaderWriter
BinaryStandardLoader -down[hidden]-> DataExporter
CatalogFinalizer -down[hidden]-> HeaderWriter

note as N_ORDER
  **序号与池块**
  序号由读线程单线程分配，
  块与文件界消息都占号，异常消息也占号。
  池块随消息走完整条链路，
  读线程是唯一借出方，写线程是唯一归还方。

  **并行度**
  工人数取 SFC_WORKERS，
  未设置时取硬件并行度，取不到退为 4。
  池容量为工人数加 2 后的 2 倍，
  单块容量为 8MB 加 1KB。
end note

note as N_COMPRESS
  **压缩流水线**
  读线程取数据块，借出池块并复制，
  分配序号后送入任务队列。
  工人压缩并两次加密，原地覆写池块。
  写线程按序号重排后纯追加写盘。
  排空后回填大小槽并加密目录区。
end note

note as N_DECOMPRESS
  **解压流水线**
  读线程解密目录区，顺序读数据区，
  每文件先发 FileStart 并预计算输出上限。
  工人两次解密后解压，原地覆写池块。
  写线程按序号重排，按文件开关输出。
  排空后统一重建链接。
end note

@enduml
